{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"content":"The air grew thick with the competing scents of saltwater brine and overripe peaches, hanging heavy over the cobblestones. Vendors shouted in rapid, guttural tongues, their voices clashing with the rhythmic clatter of scales being balanced against baskets of silver-scaled sardines. An old woman in a faded mittened hand pointed imperiously at a pile of figs, her eyes sharp with the practiced vacancy of someone who had been bartering for fish since before the war began. Nearby, a boy with dirt caked beneath his fingernails tossed a handful of oranges into the air, attempting a juggling act to draw a small, reluctant crowd, while his mother watched from behind a stack of linen cloth, arms crossed, offering no encouragement. The sun climbed higher, cutting through the haze of steam rising from a nearby soup stall, turning the dust into a golden suspension that made the whole square shimmer like a mirage on the horizon.","role":"assistant"}}],"created":1792461045,"id":"chatcmpl-18e019d3100b7aff006f","model":"qwen3.8-27b-fp8","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"aien_sampling":{"greedy_tokens":0,"kept":[248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,248320,24832